  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development would require external steps raised more than 0.3 metres above the adjoining ground level in order to align the finished floor level of the extension with that of the existing dwelling. The raised steps would constitute a raised platform and is therefore excluded from permitted development by Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, paragraph A.1(k)(i) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended). Accordingly, the proposed development would not be lawful and planning permission would be required."
